tem is not on the map. Items already stored in your bag are never collected again.","Teleports to each wounded teammate, heals, and returns to your original position. Use this if ranged heal is rejected by the server.","When a boss (IsBoss attribute) STARTS an attack animation and you are inside its danger radius, teleports you OUT of range and returns you to the exact same spot when the animation ends. Paused while Auto Farm Ore or Auto Drive is on.","While Auto Drive is on: when a DungeonGate is closer than the stop distance, the throttle is no longer forced and the drill stops by itself. It resumes when the gate is no longer in range.",{},"Needs 'Auto Stop at Dungeon Gate'. After stopping, fires the gate's ProximityPrompt (DungeonDoorReady) automatically. Only works if your executor has fireproximityprompt.","Champions_Hammer ONLY: KillAura swings it as a HEAVY attack with the game's real payload (Swing + Heavy + impact delay 2.72 + server time). With any other weapon this toggle does nothing.","Ignore the pattern list: dodge whenever the boss starts ANY new animation near you. Safer against unknown bosses, but may dodge on idle animations.","ON: Auto Collect only picks the categories ticked in the list (nothing if none is ticked) and IGNORES the Ignored Items list for them. OFF: normal behavior, everything is collected.","\226\128\162 UI: mini windows - press the button next to a groupbox title: the menu closes and the mini opens (movable); it hides while the menu is open","Only equips the sword while you are SEATED on the drill seat (that is where KillAura needs it). Works with every sword (class swords included) and never takes the hand from your pickaxe, bag, medkit or the tool you are holding. Away from the drill your hand stays as you left it. In Auto Mine, a live FuelLeech on the tank temporarily swaps sword -> pickaxe -> sword."end else e=w q,n=0x39f0/q,e end until false end end,function(a,...)return a:k()(...)end,h=function(...)return{[1]={...},[0b10]=se